__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
# Ingested/seeded pipeline data may be a real CRM export (customer names,
# amounts, contacts). Default-deny data exports at ANY depth and in the common
# export formats, plus repo-root drops (the README's --init example writes
# your_export.csv there). The synthetic demo snapshots that ship with the repo
# (and are baked into the container image) are the only whitelisted exceptions.
# To add a NEW synthetic demo file, add an explicit "!" line for it -- opt-in is
# the point, so a real export can never be committed by accident.
/*.csv
/*.xlsx
/*.xls
data/**/*.csv
data/**/*.xlsx
data/**/*.xls
data/**/*.db
data/**/*.sqlite
data/**/*.sqlite3
!data/opps_2026-08-10.csv
!data/snapshots/opps_2026-07-20.csv
!data/snapshots/opps_2026-07-27.csv
!data/snapshots/opps_2026-08-03.csv
!data/snapshots/opps_2026-08-10.csv
out/*.md
out/digests/
.venv/
